arguments.cmd:
cat > /app/output/index.html <<'HTML'
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>CreativeHub — Online Classes for Creatives</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CreativeHub helps creative professionals and aspiring artists level up with classes from world-class instructors." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-main: oklch(98% 0.008 250);
      --bg-dark: oklch(20% 0.045 258);
      --bg-dark-soft: oklch(27% 0.04 258);
      --text-main: oklch(25% 0.02 255);
      --text-inverse: oklch(98% 0.01 255);
      --muted: oklch(64% 0.03 255);
      --card: oklch(100% 0 0);
      --border: oklch(90% 0.01 250);
      --coral: oklch(70% 0.19 35);
      --green: oklch(78% 0.19 146);
      --yellow: oklch(86% 0.16 92);
      --purple: oklch(67% 0.16 290);
      --radius-xl: 24px;
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --shadow: 0 16px 36px oklch(25% 0.03 250 / 0.10);
      --container: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      --speed: 220ms;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text-main);
      background: var(--bg-main);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, h4 {
      font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", "Inter", sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    p { margin: 0; }

    .container { width: var(--container); margin-inline: auto; }

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 30;
      background: oklch(98% 0.008 250 / 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .header-inner {
      height: 76px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .7rem;
      font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(140deg, var(--coral), var(--purple));
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: .55rem .9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: background var(--speed);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { background: oklch(93% 0.02 250); }

    .btn {
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: .85rem 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform var(--speed), box-shadow var(--speed), background var(--speed);
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(140deg, var(--coral), oklch(67% 0.16 18));
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px oklch(66% 0.17 25 / .35);
    }

    .btn-dark {
      background: oklch(24% 0.04 258);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-light {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid oklch(88% 0.015 255);
      color: oklch(30% 0.03 255);
    }

    .hero {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 8% 5%, oklch(30% 0.09 280), transparent 34%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 94% 90%, oklch(68% 0.19 40 / .28), transparent 30%),
                  linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bg-dark), var(--bg-dark-soft));
      color: var(--text-inverse);
      padding: 4.8rem 0 3rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.08fr .92fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: .5rem;
      background: oklch(100% 0 0 / .11);
      border: 1px solid oklch(100% 0 0 / .2);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: .4rem .8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: .88rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      max-width: 15ch;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.06rem;
      color: oklch(93% 0.01 255 / .88);
      max-width: 54ch;
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    }

    .hero-signup {
      display: grid;
      gap: .75rem;
      max-width: 440px;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }

    .signup-btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: .65rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: .95rem 1rem;
    }

    .hero-note {
      color: oklch(90% 0.015 255 / .82);
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    .pills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .6rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .pill {
      border: 1px solid oklch(100% 0 0 / .22);
      color: white;
      background: oklch(100% 0 0 / .09);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: .45rem .85rem;
      font-size: .86rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background var(--speed), transform var(--speed);
    }

    .pill:hover { background: oklch(100% 0 0 / .18); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .hero-visual {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 1rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .hero-visual img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 16px;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: .9rem;
    }

    .mini-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: .7rem;
    }

    .mini {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: .75rem;
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 4.4rem 0;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      margin-bottom: .9rem;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .muted { color: var(--muted); }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1.3rem;
      transition: transform var(--speed), box-shadow var(--speed);
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 28px oklch(28% 0.02 250 / .08);
    }

    .icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: .8rem;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: white;
    }

    .stats {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, oklch(88% 0.09 75), oklch(86% 0.14 45));
      color: oklch(25% 0.04 255);
      border-top: 1px solid oklch(83% 0.12 60);
      border-bottom: 1px solid oklch(83% 0.12 60);
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .stat {
      text-align: center;
      padding: .8rem;
    }

    .stat strong {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      display: block;
      font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: .35rem;
    }

    .tabs {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .6rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }

    .tab {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: white;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: .52rem .95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-main);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .tab.active {
      background: oklch(27% 0.04 258);
      color: white;
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    .courses-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .course {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform var(--speed), box-shadow var(--speed);
    }

    .course:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }

    .course img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 180px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .course-body { padding: 1rem; display: grid; gap: .45rem; }

    .course h3 { font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.3; }

    .meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: .7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .9rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .feed-grid, .testimonials-grid, .teams-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: .9rem;
    }

    .feed-item, .quote, .team {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .teachers-wrap {
      position: relative;
    }

    .teacher-track {
      display: grid;
      grid-auto-flow: column;
      grid-auto-columns: minmax(210px, 1fr);
      gap: .9rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      padding-bottom: .5rem;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
    }

    .teacher {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1rem;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }

    .teacher img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 170px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      object-fit: cover;
      margin-bottom: .7rem;
    }

    .carousel-controls {
      position: absolute;
      top: -3.3rem;
      right: 0;
      display: flex;
      gap: .4rem;
    }

    .carousel-controls button {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: white;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .faq {
      background: oklch(99% 0.004 250);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .faq-list { display: grid; gap: .7rem; }

    .faq-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: white;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .faq-q {
      width: 100%;
      background: white;
      border: 0;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .faq-a {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      transition: max-height var(--speed), padding var(--speed);
    }

    .faq-item.open .faq-a { max-height: 200px; padding: 0 1rem 1rem; }
    .faq-item .plus { transition: transform var(--speed); }
    .faq-item.open .plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }

    .footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      background: oklch(23% 0.04 258);
      color: oklch(92% 0.01 255);
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: .8rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-grid, .features-grid, .courses-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .feed-grid, .testimonials-grid, .teams-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .nav-links a:nth-child(-n+2) { display: none; }
      .hero-grid, .features-grid, .courses-grid,
      .feed-grid, .testimonials-grid, .teams-grid,
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { padding-top: 3.2rem; }
      .carousel-controls { position: static; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
      .section { padding: 3.5rem 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="brand" aria-label="CreativeHub Home">
        <span class="brand-mark">C</span>
        <span>CreativeHub</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="index.html">Browse</a>
        <a href="index.html">Sign In</a>
        <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:.7rem 1rem; color:white;">Sign Up</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">✨ Build creative confidence daily</span>
          <h1>Learn from top creatives and launch your next masterpiece.</h1>
          <p>Join 425k+ makers leveling up in design, illustration, animation, photography, music, and more — with classes made for real creative growth.</p>

          <div class="hero-signup">
            <button class="btn btn-light signup-btn" id="cta-google">🔎 Continue with Google</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary signup-btn" id="cta-email">✉️ Continue with email</button>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note">Start your free trial now. Cancel anytime.</p>

          <div class="pills" aria-label="Course categories">
            <button class="pill">Graphic Design</button>
            <button class="pill">Illustration</button>
            <button class="pill">Animation</button>
            <button class="pill">Film & Video</button>
            <button class="pill">Freelance</button>
            <button class="pill">UI/UX Design</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-visual" aria-label="Featured creative class card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460661419201-fd4cecdf8a8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Creative workspace with drawing tools" />
          <div class="mini-cards">
            <div class="mini"><strong>30k+</strong><br>On-demand classes</div>
            <div class="mini"><strong>4.8 ★</strong><br>App Store rating</div>
            <div class="mini"><strong>9k+</strong><br>Creative teachers</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Why creatives choose CreativeHub</h2>
            <p class="muted">Everything you need to learn, practice, and create confidently.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="features-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon" style="background: var(--coral);">↗</div>
            <h3>Project-first learning</h3>
            <p class="muted">Build portfolio-ready work through practical, guided classes.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon" style="background: var(--green);">⏱</div>
            <h3>Short and deep formats</h3>
            <p class="muted">From 15-minute quick wins to full creative masterclasses.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon" style="background: var(--purple);">🎯</div>
            <h3>Learn from real pros</h3>
            <p class="muted">Instructors working at top studios and agencies worldwide.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section stats">
      <div class="container stats-grid">
        <div class="stat"><strong>425k+</strong><span>Active members</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>30k+</strong><span>Online classes</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>9k+</strong><span>Expert teachers</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>4.8</strong><span>App Store rating</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="courses">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Explore classes by category</h2>
            <p class="muted">Switch topics instantly and find your next obsession.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Course categories">
          <button class="tab active" data-category="featured" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Featured</button>
          <button class="tab" data-category="music" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Music</button>
          <button class="tab" data-category="drawing" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Drawing & Painting</button>
          <button class="tab" data-category="marketing" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Marketing</button>
          <button class="tab" data-category="animation" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Animation</button>
        </div>

        <div class="courses-grid" id="courses-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Creative feed inspiration</h2>
            <p class="muted">Daily ideas and mini-guides to keep momentum high.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feed-grid">
          <article class="feed-item"><strong>Color Study Sprint</strong><p class="muted">Train your eye with 5 daily palette exercises.</p></article>
          <article class="feed-item"><strong>Poster in 30 Minutes</strong><p class="muted">Rapid layout prompts for better composition.</p></article>
          <article class="feed-item"><strong>Reel Breakdown</strong><p class="muted">How top motion artists structure transitions.</p></article>
          <article class="feed-item"><strong>Creator Workflow</strong><p class="muted">A repeatable process from sketch to final export.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Learn from Creative Experts</h2>
            <p class="muted">Scroll and discover mentors across every discipline.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="teachers-wrap">
          <div class="carousel-controls" aria-label="Teacher carousel controls">
            <button id="teachers-prev" aria-label="Previous teachers">←</button>
            <button id="teachers-next" aria-label="Next teachers">→</button>
          </div>
          <div class="teacher-track" id="teacher-track">
            <article class="teacher"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544723795-3fb6469f5b39?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Teacher portrait"/><h3>Maya Rivera</h3><p class="muted">Illustrator</p></article>
            <article class="teacher"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Teacher portrait"/><h3>Danny Park</h3><p class="muted">Digital Designer</p></article>
            <article class="teacher"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Teacher portrait"/><h3>Nova Chen</h3><p class="muted">Animator, Product Designer</p></article>
            <article class="teacher"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108755-2616b612b786?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Teacher portrait"/><h3>Sofia Grant</h3><p class="muted">Graphic Designer</p></article>
            <article class="teacher"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488426862026-3ee34a7d66df?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Teacher portrait"/><h3>Amelia Brooks</h3><p class="muted">Watercolor Artist</p></article>
            <article class="teacher"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557862921-37829c790f19?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Teacher portrait"/><h3>Leo Kim</h3><p class="muted">Motion Graphics Artist</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head"><h2>What students are saying</h2></div>
        <div class="testimonials-grid">
          <article class="quote"><p>“CreativeHub is the best learning decision I've ever made.”</p><p class="muted">— Jess, Product Designer</p></article>
          <article class="quote"><p>“Real-world skills without the financial burden.”</p><p class="muted">— Malik, Freelancer</p></article>
          <article class="quote"><p>“It's the one subscription I can't imagine not having.”</p><p class="muted">— Tara, Illustrator</p></article>
          <article class="quote"><p>“The projects and feedback help me level up my skills every week.”</p><p class="muted">— Ryan, Motion Designer</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head"><h2>Trusted by creative teams</h2></div>
        <div class="teams-grid">
          <article class="team">Studio North</article>
          <article class="team">Pixel Forge</article>
          <article class="team">Daylight Labs</article>
          <article class="team">Framehouse</article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section faq" id="faq">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="muted">Everything you need before starting your free trial.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-list" id="faq-list">
          <article class="faq-item open">
            <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true">What is CreativeHub? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-a"><p>CreativeHub is an online learning platform for creatives, offering thousands of classes in design, illustration, animation, video, and more.</p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is included in my membership? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
            <div class="faq-a"><p>Membership includes unlimited access to all classes, project resources, downloadable templates, and community learning features.</p></div>
          </article>
